    faqs: [
      { q: 'How is this different from a generic planner template?', a: 'Generic planners give you the same layout as everyone else. Study Planner Pro embeds your name, subjects, and goals into every page — the cover, the semester overview, the weekly spreads, the revision tracker. Your system is yours.' },
