      { q: 'What pages are included?', a: 'Personalized cover, semester overview, 12 weekly spreads, 3-pass revision tracker (up to 8 subjects), assignment planner, lecture notes, exam countdown, study log, and analytics dashboard. Every page connected.' },
      { q: 'Is there a live web app?', a: 'Yes. After purchase you get access to the full interactive app at /app/study-planner-pro. Open your browser, enter your subjects and dates, and start using it immediately on any device.' }
    ],
